{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Second plan-review remediation: broadened the regression oracle from only prevent-destroy/blast-radius to no T10 finding of any class, with explicit endpoint-access (b2), blast-radius (d), and teardown (g) cases; recorded the targeted test file in file impact. Deferred P7 because the word destroy names a finding, not an operation. Accepted the unlabeled-resource advisory because the exclusion is intentionally conservative: without an explicit throwaway lifecycle, T10 still applies."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786551594916220001,"uuid":"9e93fbdd-b59b-4bbe-9ee9-0e29fa6b2d96"}